Step 5: Assigns Identifiers And Addressing
5.1) Automatically derives the connected leaf and leaf interface(s) and assigns unique /64 prefixes.

5.2) Calculates a unique /56 prefix for the tenant by offsetting within the /48 base.

5.3) Generates per-tenant VNI, VRF Target, and Community Name

5.4) Builds per-leaf route distinguishers (RDs) using:  <leaf-router-id>:<rd_counter>

5.5) Stores all leaf-RD mappings under ROUTE_DISTINGUISHER_MAP
